325
00:29:44,583 --> 00:29:46,333
Jaga keduanya tetap tajam setiap saat.

326
00:29:51,916 --> 00:29:53,166
{\an8}Kau tahu arti nama ini?

327
00:29:54,125 --> 00:29:55,000
Singa.

